    "text": "Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced open=\"{\" close=\"}\"><mrow><mi>M</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><msub><mi>a</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced open=\"{\" close=\"}\"><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced open=\"{\" close=\"}\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>&#8804;</mo><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>j</mi><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math> be a sample space and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mrow><mi>M</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>S</mi><mo>:</mo><mi>M</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mtext>is&#160;invertible</mtext></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;be an even. Then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mi>A</mi></mfenced></math> is equal to",
